A version file with no lens, whose schema requires a field beneath a struct
the prior version has: the block the help offers nests the field in its
struct, as CUE writes it, rather than naming it by its dotted path.
-- ship/history/0.0.thema --
Schema: {
	id: string
	meta: {
		owner: string
	}
}
-- ship/history/1.0.thema --
Schema: {
	id: string
	meta: {
		owner: string
		team:  string
	}
}
-- ship/tip.thema --
Schema: {
	id: string
	meta: {
		owner: string
		team:  string
	}
}
-- out/error --
error[E0346]: v1.0 has no ForwardLens, and v1.0 requires meta.team
 --> history/1.0.thema:7:1
  |
7 | }
  | ^
  |
  = help: write ForwardLens: {v0_0: _, v1_0: {meta: {team: <mapping>}}} in history/1.0.thema
